		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Thin, greenish ghoul with a head that is all mouth. Formed from mortals filled with avarice. Loves to torture but not kill.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 24, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +4 (1d8 + flesh mold), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Flesh Mold</strong>. Rearrange flesh of the living. DEX 12+ or totenmaske erases one sense: sight, smell, hearing, or speech. Restoration to regain.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
